{"id":71,"name":"نوح","transliteration":"Nuh","translation_fr":"Noé","translation_en":"Noah","type":"meccan","total_verses":28,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا نُوحًا إِلَىٰ قَوۡمِهِۦٓ أَنۡ أَنذِرۡ قَوۡمَكَ مِن قَبۡلِ أَن يَأۡتِيَهُمۡ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٞ","translation_fr":"Nous avons envoyé Noé vers son peuple: «Avertis ton peuple, avant que leur vienne un châtiment douloureux»","translation_en":"Indeed, We sent Noah to his people, [saying], \"Warn your people before there comes to them a painful punishment","transliteration":"Inna arsalna noohan ila qawmihi an anthir qawmaka min qabli an yatiyahum AAathabun aleemun"},{"id":2,"text":"قَالَ يَٰقَوۡمِ إِنِّي لَكُمۡ نَذِيرٞ مُّبِينٌ","translation_fr":"Il [leur] dit: «O mon peuple, je suis vraiment pour vous, un avertisseur clair","translation_en":"He said, \"O my people, indeed I am to you a clear warner","transliteration":"Qala ya qawmi innee lakum natheerun mubeenun"},{"id":3,"text":"أَنِ ٱعۡبُدُواْ ٱللَّهَ وَٱتَّقُوهُ وَأَطِيعُونِ","translation_fr":"Adorez Allah, craignez-Le et obéissez-moi","translation_en":"[Saying], 'Worship Allah, fear Him and obey me","transliteration":"Ani oAAbudoo Allaha waittaqoohu waateeAAooni"},{"id":4,"text":"يَغۡفِرۡ لَكُم مِّن ذُنُوبِكُمۡ وَيُؤَخِّرۡكُمۡ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٖ مُّسَمًّىۚ إِنَّ أَجَلَ ٱللَّهِ إِذَا جَآءَ لَا يُؤَخَّرُۚ لَوۡ كُنتُمۡ تَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"pour qu'Il vous pardonne vos péchés et qu'Il vous donne un délai jusqu'à un terme fixé. Mais quand vient le terme fixé par Allah, il ne saurait être différé si vous saviez!»","translation_en":"Allah will forgive you of your sins and delay you for a specified term. Indeed, the time [set by] Allah, when it comes, will not be delayed, if you only knew","transliteration":"Yaghfir lakum min thunoobikum wayuakhkhirkum ila ajalin musamman inna ajala Allahi itha jaa la yuakhkharu law kuntum taAAlamoona"},{"id":5,"text":"قَالَ رَبِّ إِنِّي دَعَوۡتُ قَوۡمِي لَيۡلٗا وَنَهَارٗا","translation_fr":"Il dit: «Seigneur! J'ai appelé mon peuple, nuit et jour","translation_en":"He said, \"My Lord, indeed I invited my people [to truth] night and day","transliteration":"Qala rabbi innee daAAawtu qawmee laylan wanaharan"},{"id":6,"text":"فَلَمۡ يَزِدۡهُمۡ دُعَآءِيٓ إِلَّا فِرَارٗا","translation_fr":"Mais mon appel n'a fait qu'accroître leur fuite","translation_en":"But my invitation increased them not except in flight","transliteration":"Falam yazidhum duAAaee illa firaran"},{"id":7,"text":"وَإِنِّي كُلَّمَا دَعَوۡتُهُمۡ لِتَغۡفِرَ لَهُمۡ جَعَلُوٓاْ أَصَٰبِعَهُمۡ فِيٓ ءَاذَانِهِمۡ وَٱسۡتَغۡشَوۡاْ ثِيَابَهُمۡ وَأَصَرُّواْ وَٱسۡتَكۡبَرُواْ ٱسۡتِكۡبَارٗا","translation_fr":"Et chaque fois que je les ai appelés pour que Tu leur pardonnes, ils ont mis leurs doigts dans leurs oreilles. se sont enveloppés de leurs vêtements, se sont entêtés et se sont montrés extrêmement orgueilleux","translation_en":"And indeed, every time I invited them that You may forgive them, they put their fingers in their ears, covered themselves with their garments, persisted, and were arrogant with [great] arrogance","transliteration":"Wainnee kullama daAAawtuhum litaghfira lahum jaAAaloo asabiAAahum fee athanihim waistaghshaw thiyabahum waasarroo waistakbaroo istikbaran"},{"id":8,"text":"ثُمَّ إِنِّي دَعَوۡتُهُمۡ جِهَارٗا","translation_fr":"Ensuite, je les ai appelés ouvertement","translation_en":"Then I invited them publicly","transliteration":"Thumma innee daAAawtuhum jiharan"},{"id":9,"text":"ثُمَّ إِنِّيٓ أَعۡلَنتُ لَهُمۡ وَأَسۡرَرۡتُ لَهُمۡ إِسۡرَارٗا","translation_fr":"Puis, je leur ai fait des proclamations publiques, et des confidences en secret","translation_en":"Then I announced to them and [also] confided to them secretly","transliteration":"Thumma innee aAAlantu lahum waasrartu lahum israran"},{"id":10,"text":"فَقُلۡتُ ٱسۡتَغۡفِرُواْ رَبَّكُمۡ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ غَفَّارٗا","translation_fr":"J'ai donc dit: «Implorez le pardon de votre Seigneur, car Il est grand Pardonneur","translation_en":"And said, 'Ask forgiveness of your Lord. Indeed, He is ever a Perpetual Forgiver","transliteration":"Faqultu istaghfiroo rabbakum innahu kana ghaffaran"},{"id":11,"text":"يُرۡسِلِ ٱلسَّمَآءَ عَلَيۡكُم مِّدۡرَارٗا","translation_fr":"pour qu'Il vous envoie du ciel, des pluies abondantes","translation_en":"He will send [rain from] the sky upon you in [continuing] showers","transliteration":"Yursili alssamaa AAalaykum midraran"},{"id":12,"text":"وَيُمۡدِدۡكُم بِأَمۡوَٰلٖ وَبَنِينَ وَيَجۡعَل لَّكُمۡ جَنَّـٰتٖ وَيَجۡعَل لَّكُمۡ أَنۡهَٰرٗا","translation_fr":"et qu'Il vous accorde beaucoup de biens et d'enfants, et vous donne des jardins et vous donne des rivières","translation_en":"And give you increase in wealth and children and provide for you gardens and provide for you rivers","transliteration":"Wayumdidkum biamwalin wabaneena wayajAAal lakum jannatin wayajAAal lakum anharan"},{"id":13,"text":"مَّا لَكُمۡ لَا تَرۡجُونَ لِلَّهِ وَقَارٗا","translation_fr":"Qu'avez-vous à ne pas vénérer Allah comme il se doit","translation_en":"What is [the matter] with you that you do not attribute to Allah [due] grandeur","transliteration":"Ma lakum la tarjoona lillahi waqaran"},{"id":14,"text":"وَقَدۡ خَلَقَكُمۡ أَطۡوَارًا","translation_fr":"alors qu'Il vous a créés par phases successives","translation_en":"While He has created you in stages","transliteration":"Waqad khalaqakum atwaran"},{"id":15,"text":"أَلَمۡ تَرَوۡاْ كَيۡفَ خَلَقَ ٱللَّهُ سَبۡعَ سَمَٰوَٰتٖ طِبَاقٗا","translation_fr":"N'avez-vous pas vu comment Allah a créé sept cieux superposés","translation_en":"Do you not consider how Allah has created seven heavens in layers","transliteration":"Alam taraw kayfa khalaqa Allahu sabAAa samawatin tibaqan"},{"id":16,"text":"وَجَعَلَ ٱلۡقَمَرَ فِيهِنَّ نُورٗا وَجَعَلَ ٱلشَّمۡسَ سِرَاجٗا","translation_fr":"et y a fait de la lune une lumière et du soleil une lampe","translation_en":"And made the moon therein a [reflected] light and made the sun a burning lamp","transliteration":"WajaAAala alqamara feehinna nooran wajaAAala alshshamsa sirajan"},{"id":17,"text":"وَٱللَّهُ أَنۢبَتَكُم مِّنَ ٱلۡأَرۡضِ نَبَاتٗا","translation_fr":"Et c'est Allah qui, de la terre, vous a fait croître comme des plantes","translation_en":"And Allah has caused you to grow from the earth a [progressive] growth","transliteration":"WaAllahu anbatakum mina alardi nabatan"},{"id":18,"text":"ثُمَّ يُعِيدُكُمۡ فِيهَا وَيُخۡرِجُكُمۡ إِخۡرَاجٗا","translation_fr":"puis Il vous y fera retourner et vous en fera sortir véritablement","translation_en":"Then He will return you into it and extract you [another] extraction","transliteration":"Thumma yuAAeedukum feeha wayukhrijukum ikhrajan"},{"id":19,"text":"وَٱللَّهُ جَعَلَ لَكُمُ ٱلۡأَرۡضَ بِسَاطٗا","translation_fr":"Et c'est Allah qui vous a fait de la terre un tapis","translation_en":"And Allah has made for you the earth an expanse","transliteration":"WaAllahu jaAAala lakumu alarda bisatan"},{"id":20,"text":"لِّتَسۡلُكُواْ مِنۡهَا سُبُلٗا فِجَاجٗا","translation_fr":"pour que vous vous acheminiez par ses voies spacieuses»","translation_en":"That you may follow therein roads of passage","transliteration":"Litaslukoo minha subulan fijajan"},{"id":21,"text":"قَالَ نُوحٞ رَّبِّ إِنَّهُمۡ عَصَوۡنِي وَٱتَّبَعُواْ مَن لَّمۡ يَزِدۡهُ مَالُهُۥ وَوَلَدُهُۥٓ إِلَّا خَسَارٗا","translation_fr":"Noé dit: «Seigneur, ils m'ont désobéi et ils ont suivi celui dont les biens et les enfants n'ont fait qu'accroître la perte","translation_en":"Noah said, \"My Lord, indeed they have disobeyed me and followed him whose wealth and children will not increase him except in loss","transliteration":"Qala noohun rabbi innahum AAasawnee waittabaAAoo man lam yazidhu maluhu wawaladuhu illa khasaran"},{"id":22,"text":"وَمَكَرُواْ مَكۡرٗا كُبَّارٗا","translation_fr":"Ils ont ourdi un immense stratagème","translation_en":"And they conspired an immense conspiracy","transliteration":"Wamakaroo makran kubbaran"},{"id":23,"text":"وَقَالُواْ لَا تَذَرُنَّ ءَالِهَتَكُمۡ وَلَا تَذَرُنَّ وَدّٗا وَلَا سُوَاعٗا وَلَا يَغُوثَ وَيَعُوقَ وَنَسۡرٗا","translation_fr":"et ils ont dit: «N'abandonnez jamais vos divinités et n'abandonnez jamais Wadd, Suwâ, Yaghhû, Ya'ûq et Nasr","translation_en":"And said, 'Never leave your gods and never leave Wadd or Suwa' or Yaghuth and Ya'uq and Nasr","transliteration":"Waqaloo la tatharunna alihatakum wala tatharunna waddan wala suwaAAan wala yaghootha wayaAAooqa wanasran"},{"id":24,"text":"وَقَدۡ أَضَلُّواْ كَثِيرٗاۖ وَلَا تَزِدِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ إِلَّا ضَلَٰلٗا","translation_fr":"Elles [les idoles] ont déjà égaré plusieurs. Ne fais (Seigneur) croître les injustes qu'en égarement","translation_en":"And already they have misled many. And, [my Lord], do not increase the wrongdoers except in error","transliteration":"Waqad adalloo katheeran wala tazidi alththalimeena illa dalalan"},{"id":25,"text":"مِّمَّا خَطِيٓـَٰٔتِهِمۡ أُغۡرِقُواْ فَأُدۡخِلُواْ نَارٗا فَلَمۡ يَجِدُواْ لَهُم مِّن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ أَنصَارٗا","translation_fr":"A cause de leurs fautes, ils ont été noyés, puis on les a fait entrer au Feu, et ils n'ont pas trouvé en dehors d'Allah, de secoureurs»","translation_en":"Because of their sins they were drowned and put into the Fire, and they found not for themselves besides Allah [any] helpers","transliteration":"Mimma khateeatihim oghriqoo faodkhiloo naran falam yajidoo lahum min dooni Allahi ansaran"},{"id":26,"text":"وَقَالَ نُوحٞ رَّبِّ لَا تَذَرۡ عَلَى ٱلۡأَرۡضِ مِنَ ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ دَيَّارًا","translation_fr":"Et Noé dit: «Seigneur, ne laisse sur la terre aucun infidèle","translation_en":"And Noah said, \"My Lord, do not leave upon the earth from among the disbelievers an inhabitant","transliteration":"Waqala noohun rabbi la tathar AAala alardi mina alkafireena dayyaran"},{"id":27,"text":"إِنَّكَ إِن تَذَرۡهُمۡ يُضِلُّواْ عِبَادَكَ وَلَا يَلِدُوٓاْ إِلَّا فَاجِرٗا كَفَّارٗا","translation_fr":"Si Tu les laisses [en vie], ils égareront Tes serviteurs et n'engendreront que des pécheurs infidèles","translation_en":"Indeed, if You leave them, they will mislead Your servants and not beget except [every] wicked one and [confirmed] disbeliever","transliteration":"Innaka in tatharhum yudilloo AAibadaka wala yalidoo illa fajiran kaffaran"},{"id":28,"text":"رَّبِّ ٱغۡفِرۡ لِي وَلِوَٰلِدَيَّ وَلِمَن دَخَلَ بَيۡتِيَ مُؤۡمِنٗا وَلِلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ وَٱلۡمُؤۡمِنَٰتِۖ وَلَا تَزِدِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ إِلَّا تَبَارَۢا","translation_fr":"Seigneur! Pardonne-moi, et à mes père et mère et à celui qui entre dans ma demeure croyant, ainsi qu'aux croyants et croyantes; et ne fais croître les injustes qu'en perdition»","translation_en":"My Lord, forgive me and my parents and whoever enters my house a believer and the believing men and believing women. And do not increase the wrongdoers except in destruction","transliteration":"Rabbi ighfir lee waliwalidayya waliman dakhala baytiya muminan walilmumineena waalmuminati wala tazidi alththalimeena illa tabaran"}]}